1 1 1 ff19SB 'implicit: GB-Neck2 (igb=8, mbondi3 radii)' NVT 300 . 4 403.650 30
2 'MELD: temperature + Hamiltonian replica exchange'
'MELD (Modeling Employing Limited Data) folding from an extended chain built from sequence with tleap. 30 replicas, geometric temperature ladder 300-550 K over the first 30% of replicas; exchanges every 50 ps (12500 steps). Restraints: secondary structure from ss.dat (28 helix/strand windows, 85% active, constant strength), strand pairing (213 groups, 10 active) and hydrophobic contacts (121 groups, 21 active), both scaled nonlinearly from 1.0 to 0.4 along the replica ladder and faded in over the first 200 exchanges. Langevin thermostat (gamma 2/ps), SHAKE on bonds to hydrogen, no nonbonded cutoff. Analysed: replica 1 (300 K, full restraint strength; Amber file meld.nc.001).'
